OL,3,GNEWSAPaperless parking rollout for
OL,4,Adistrict car parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaperless ticket machines will be
OL,7,Finstalled at car parks across a
OL,8,Fdistrict in Leicestershire next week.
OL,10,FThe new machines are to be introduced
OL,11,Fat five car parks in Blaby and
OL,12,FNarborough on 29 and 30 September, the
OL,13,Fdistrict council said.
OL,15,FAs a result, customers won't need to
OL,16,Freturn to their vehicles to display
OL,17,Fparking tickets but will instead be
OL,18,Fasked to input their car registration
OL,19,Fusing a touch screen.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
