OL,3,GNEWSAPaperless parking rollout for
OL,4,Adistrict car parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlder parking machines will be replaced
OL,7,Fat the Enderby Road and Johns Court car
OL,8,Fparks in Blaby and the Leicester Road,
OL,9,FWeavers Court and The Station car parks
OL,10,Fin Narborough.
